thamizhththenpudhuvaivittuchiththansolaindhinoduaindhumvallarkkuallalillaiye"],[318,"nerindhakarungkuzhalmadavayninadiyenvinnappamserindhamanimudichchanakansilaiiruththuninaikkonarndhadhuarindhuarasukalaikattaarunthavaththonidaivilanggaserindhasilaikoduthavaththaichchidhaiththadhumoradaiyalam"],[319,"alliampumalarkkodhayadipanindhenvinnappamsollugenkettarulaythunaimalarkkanmadamaneelliampodhuinidhuiruththalirundhadhoridavagaiyilmalligaimamalaikonduangguarththadhumoradaiyalam"],[320,"kalakkiyamamanaththanalaykkaikesivaramvendamalakkiyamamanaththananaymannavanummaradhozhiyakulakkumarakaduraiyappoenruvidaikoduppailakkumananthannodumangguegiyadhuoradaiyalam"],[321,"varanindhamulaimadavayvaidhevivinnappamtheranindhaayoththiyarkonperundhevikettarulaykuranindhavelvalavanguganodumganggaithannilsiranindhathozhamaikondadhumoradaiyalam"],[322,"manamarumennokkivaidhevivinnappamkanamarumkalladharpoykkaduraindhakalaththuthenamarumpozhilsaralchiththirakudaththuiruppapalmozhiyaybaradhanambipanindhadhumoradaiyalam"],[323,"chiththirakudaththuiruppachchirukakkaimulaithindaaththiramekonderiyaanaiththulagumthirindhodiviththaganeiramaoninabayamenruazhaippaaththirameadhankannaiaruththadhumoradaiyalam"],[324,"minnoththanunnidaiyaymeyyadiyenvinnappamponnoththamanonrupugundhuinidhuvilaiyadaninanbinvazhininrusilaipidiththuempiranegapinneangguilakkumananpirindhadhumoradaiyalam"],[325,"maiththagumamalarkkuzhalayvaidhevivinnappamoththapugazhvanarakkonudanirundhuninaiththedaaththagusirayoththiyarkonadaiyalamivaimozhindhaniththagaiyaladaiyalamidhuavankaimodhirame"],[326,"thikkuniraipugazhalanthivelvichchenranalmikkaperumsabainaduveviliruththanmodhiramkanduokkumaladaiyalamanumanenruuchchimelvaiththukkonduugandhanalalmalarkkuzhalalsithaiyume"],[327,"vararummulaimadavalvaidhevithanaikkandusirarumthiralanumantherindhuuraiththaadaiyalampararumpugazhppudhuvaippattarpiranpadalvallarerarumvaikundhaththuimaiyavaroduiruppare"],[328,"katirayiramiravikalantuerittalottanilmutiyanetirilperumaiiramanaiirukkumita