marungguudaiththaadaiththunegizhppanokkinrayarmarundhuiniaguvaradalazhiendhiasurarvankulamvermarungguaruththayvinnularperumaneyo"],[3458,"vinnularperumarkuadimaiseyvaraiyumserumaimpulanivaimannulennaipperralenseyyamarruniyumvittalpannulaykavithanulaypaththiyinullayparamisanevandhuenkannulaynenjchulaysolulayonrusollaye"],[3459,"onrusollioruththinilnirkiladhaoraivarvankayavaraienruyanvelkirpanunthiruarulillaiyelanrudhevarasurarvanggaalaikadalaravamalaviorkunramvaiththaendhaykodiyenparuguinnamudhe"],[3460,"innamudhuenaththonrioraivaryavaraiyummayakkanivaiththamunnamayamellammuzhuverarindhuennaiunchinnamumthirumurththiyumsindhiththueththikkaithozhavearulenakkuenammaenkannaimaiyorthamkulamudhale"],[3461,"kulamudhaladumthivinaikkoduvankuzhiyinilvizhkkumaivaraivalamudhalkedukkumvalamethandharulkandaynilamudhalinievvulagukkumnirpanaselvanaenaporulpalamudhalpadaiththayenkannaenparanjchudare"],[3462,"enparanjchudareenruunnaialarriuninaiththamaraigatkuanburuginirkumadhunirkachchumaduthandhayvanparanggaleduththuaivarthisaithisaivaliththuerruginranarmunparavaikadaindhuamudhamkondamurththiyo"],[3463,"kondamurththiormuvaraykgunanggalpadaiththualiththukkedukkumappundarigakkoppuzhppunarpalliappanukkethondarthondarthondarthondansadakopansolayiraththulippaththumkandupadavallarvinaipomkanggulumpagale"],[3464,"kanggulumpagalumkanthuyilariyalkannanirkaigalaliraikkumsangguchakkaranggalenrukaikuppumthamaraikkanenrethalarumengnganetharikkenunnaivittuennumirunilamkaithuzhairukkumsenggayalpaynirththiruvaranggaththayivalthiraththuenseyginraye"],[3465,"enseyginrayenthamaraikkannaennumkannirmalgairukkumenseygenerinirththiruvaranggaththayennumvevvuyirththuuyirththuurugummunseydhavinaiyemugappadayennummugilvannathaguvadhoennummunseydhuivvulagamunduumizhndhualandhayenkolomudiginradhuivatke"],[3466,"vatkilaliraiyummanivannaennumvanamenokkummaiyakkumutkudaiasuraruyirellamundaoruvaneennumulurugumkatkiliunnaikkanumaruarulaykaguththakannaneennumthitkodimathilsuzhthiruvaranggaththayivalthiraththuenseydhi